              `<p>An income statement summarizes revenue minus expenses for a period. A cash view asks whether money actually arrived. Project: list last week’s spending categories and one cost you can reduce without harming health or safety.</p>`,
              [Q("f2","mcq","Revenue minus expenses on a simple income statement is closest to:",["Cash in a wallet always","Profit or loss for the period","A credit score","A tax identification number"],1,"That is the basic idea of an income statement.")]
